<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for reaching out to the Qantas Customer Care team.
<p><strong><em>If general boarding process complaint, use:</em></strong><br />
We want our customers to have a seamless and enjoyable journey when they travel with Qantas, so I'm sorry to hear about your boarding experience on {{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If Seating changed, use:</em></strong><br />
<strong>Your seating experience</strong><br />
I’m sorry to hear that we needed to change the seat you requested on your flight to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}} on {{{CASE.DEPARTURE_DATE__C}}}.<br />
<br />
While we try to meet every customer’s seating preference, sometimes this may change for operational, safety or security reasons, even after boarding the aircraft.<br />
<br />
Although we do our best to re-book you into a seat similar to the one you held, we can't always guarantee that the new seat will be exactly where you'd like it to be.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If paid for seating, add:</em></strong><br />
<strong>We've requested your refund</strong><br />
I’ve contacted our refunds area on your behalf and the fees will be refunded back to the original form of payment in approximately 7 business days.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I've passed on your comments to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>